---
description: Rules for NestJS backend implementation
globs: backend/**/*.ts, server/**/*.ts
---
- Use standard NestJS decorators and dependency injection.
- Validate incoming requests with `ZodValidationPipe` or `ValidationPipe`.
- Protect routes with JWT AuthGuards and granular SharingAccessGuards.
- Use Presigned S3 URLs (`@aws-sdk/s3-request-presigner`) for direct file upload & download.
- When generating delete operations for folders, ensure all nested entities in PostgreSQL and S3 are cleanly cleaned up or soft-handled.